===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[crested]] [[tit]]}}

# {{taxlink|Lophophanes cristatus|species|noshow=1}}, a small bird of the [[tit]] family {{l|mul|Paridae}}, with an [[erectile]] [[crest]], the tip of which is often [[recurved]].

